    "Scan of the 1994 edition of the Clay, Louisiana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1981; field checked in 1983; photo inspected in 1995; last revised in 1985; printed in 1994.",
